# ChecklistDek Project Rules

Self-hosted WordPress master hub for agencies — govern, configure, and automate remote client sites via Application Passwords and core REST APIs. Hub API checklist steps use core REST only; the bundled must-use **client checklist panel** is required on each managed site to show checklists in client wp-admin (one-time mu-plugin setup per site). PHP 7.4+, WordPress 6.2+, GPL-3.0.

See `checklistdek-standards.mdc` (quality), `checklistdek-compliance.mdc` (security gate), `wordpress-php.mdc` (PHP/REST/DB), `admin-assets.mdc` (JS/CSS).

