## Database Tables

`{prefix}checklistdek_sites` (`client_agent` flag, `integration_source`, `external_id`), `checklistdek_site_tags`, `checklistdek_checklists`, `checklistdek_runs` (`client_run_token`, `is_archived`), `checklistdek_run_steps` (`notes_json` per-step note array), `checklistdek_audit_log`, `checklistdek_connection_events`. DB 1.6.0+ composite indexes (fresh install + `migrate_performance_indexes()`): runs `site_history`, `status_archived`; run steps `run_step`; audit `site_created`; site tags `group_tag_site`. DB `1.7.0` is the ChecklistDek rebrand marker (`migrate_launchdek_branding()`). Bump `CHECKLISTDEK_Installer::DB_VERSION` for schema changes. Resolve table names in repositories via `CHECKLISTDEK_{Site,Checklist,Run}_Repository::table()`, `CHECKLISTDEK_Run_Repository::steps_table()`, and `CHECKLISTDEK_Audit_Log::table_name()` (private `table()` delegates) — use `%i` in `$wpdb->prepare()` for plugin-owned tables (WP 6.2+). Site/checklist list limits: `LIST_DEFAULT_LIMIT` 500, `LIST_MAX_LIMIT` 1000, `PICKER_LIMIT` 500 per repository.

## Client Checklist Panel (mu-plugin)

Bundled under `mu-plugin/` and deployed to remote `wp-content/mu-plugins/` by the full-build `CHECKLISTDEK_Mu_Plugin_Installer` (Community hub: manual upload only). Loader: `checklistdek-client.php` (`CHECKLISTDEK_CLIENT_PANEL_VERSION`, currently `1.0.8`); classes in `checklistdek-client/`:

| Class | Role |
|-------|------|
| `CHECKLISTDEK_Client_REST_API` | Remote routes under `checklistdek/v1/client/*` (install route delegated to install helper when present) |
| `CHECKLISTDEK_Client_REST_API_Install` | `POST /client/install` — hub pushes whitelisted bundle files (`can_hub_manage`); file omitted from Community client zip |
| `CHECKLISTDEK_Client_Run_Store` | Active run snapshot CRUD, `user_can_complete_step()` (all logged-in users when no `target_roles`), `user_can_view_panel()` (`read` required; `manage_options` always; with a valid step list, user must match at least one step `target_roles`; empty/malformed snapshots fall back to `edit_posts`), local note save/merge, `patch_from_hub_run()`, `panel_title` from snapshot (`get_panel_title()` / `sanitize_panel_title()`) |
| `CHECKLISTDEK_Client_Panel` | Admin panel UI + asset enqueue (`wp_enqueue_media()` for optional screenshot attachments; layout from snapshot `panel_layout` — `sidebar` (default), `live_topbar`, `bottom_dock`, `floating_pill`, `toast`, `admin_menu`, `fullscreen`, `focus_mode`, `inline_metabox`; legacy `left_sidebar` / `split_panel` fall back to `sidebar`; body class `checklistdek-client-layout-{layout}`; admin bar shortcut for bar/flyout layouts; `inline_metabox` registers post/page editor metabox); panel header includes ChecklistDek brand mark (`.checklistdek-client-panel-brand`, localized `strings.brandName`); panel collapses to tab via **Collapse** — collapsed/minimized chrome (sidebar tab, floating pill, toast, top/bottom bar, fullscreen launcher, admin bar badge, `admin_menu` progress trigger button) shows live progress via `formatCompactProgress()` / `syncAdminBarProgress()` on step toggles; `admin_menu` collapsed shows `.checklistdek-client-admin-menu-trigger` (progress button) instead of hiding the root; `inline_metabox` collapse keeps panel chrome with `.checklistdek-client-panel-collapsed-meta` (step · percent); steps collapsed by default — title + status; chevron expands actions/notes; per-step note sections toggle individually (prefs in `localStorage`); compact settings deep-link icon (`.checklistdek-client-step-settings-link`) when `deep_link` URL present (resolved from snapshot `deep_link` or `admin_path` via `resolve_step_deep_link()`); optional per-step note field via `show_note_field`; screenshot attach button gated by `show_screenshot_field` (requires `show_note_field`); notes require non-empty text, save locally first, optional `attachment_id`/`attachment_url` via media library; completed steps show SVG double-tick icon, `completed_by` name/email and `completed_at`; completed runs stay visible with Started/Completed summary and **Dismiss** button) |
| `CHECKLISTDEK_Client_Hub_Client` | Callbacks to hub with run token |
| `CHECKLISTDEK_Client_Auto_Capture` | Records admin actions into checklist steps during capture sessions |

Remote client REST routes (authenticated via Application Password or logged-in client user):

| Route | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `GET /client/info` | Panel presence/version probe (public) |
| `POST /client/install` | Receive bundled files from hub (`can_hub_manage`) — registered only when `class-rest-api-install.php` is in the client bundle (Pro hub deploy) |
| `GET|POST|DELETE /client/run` | Read/push/clear active run snapshot |
| `POST /client/run/dismiss` | Clear a completed checklist from the client panel (local snapshot only) |
| `POST /client/run/steps/{step}/complete` | Client completes manual step → hub callback |
| `POST /client/run/steps/{step}/uncomplete` | Client reverts completed manual step → hub callback |
| `POST /client/run/steps/{step}/notes` | Client saves note locally first, then syncs to hub (`hub_synced` in response); notes require non-empty text; optional `attachment_id`/`attachment_url` from remote media library |
| `GET|POST|DELETE /client/capture` | Read/start/stop/clear auto-capture session (requires panel) |

Hub-side orchestration: `CHECKLISTDEK_Client_Push` (`push_run`, `sync_run`, `complete_client_step`, `uncomplete_client_step`, `add_client_step_note`, `build_snapshot` — includes `panel_layout` and `panel_title`). Token callbacks use `$skip_client_sync = true` and return `snapshot` for local client apply — no redundant hub→client re-push on step toggles. Step notes stored on hub as `{ user, text, created_at, attachment_id?, attachment_url? }`; `CHECKLISTDEK_Run_Repository::filter_step_notes()` / `::step_notes_match()` dedupe empty/duplicate notes. `CHECKLISTDEK_Run_Repository::all()` excludes archived runs by default (`include_archived` opt-in); `::list_for_site_history()` returns paginated lean rows with batched `steps_total` / `steps_completed` / `progress_percent`. Automation run tracker renders notes (author · timestamp) and attachment thumbnails; hub-side **Mark Not Complete** posts `/runs/{id}/steps/{step}/uncomplete`. Sites page **Push Checklist** modal posts `POST /runs` with `push_to_client`. Automation page **Refresh Client Panel** (`#checklistdek-run-push-client`) posts `POST /runs/{id}/push-client` (`push_run( $id, false, true )`). Deep-link to a run via `?page={slug}-automation&run_id={id}`. Audit actions: `client_run_pushed`, `client_step_completed`, `client_step_uncompleted`, `client_step_note_added`, `manual_step_uncompleted`, `run_archived`, `run_deleted`.

