## Integrations

Implement `CHECKLISTDEK_Integration_Interface` in `includes/integrations/`, register in `CHECKLISTDEK_Integrations::get_all()`. **Registered connectors:** MainWP, WP Umbrella. Adapter classes for ManageWP, WP Engine, and WPvibe remain under `integrations/` but are commented out in `class-checklistdek-integrations.php` until implemented—do not register them without finishing sync/push behavior. Display names use `* Connector` suffix (translatable). Interface methods: `get_slug()`, `get_name()`, `is_available()`, `supports_site_sync()`, `fetch_platform_sites()`, `push_agent( $site_ids )`, `get_status()`.

Integrations admin page (`checklistdek-integrations-page.php`) has two sections (each `h2` uses `.checklistdek-card-heading-row--info-first` + `.checklistdek-field-info.checklistdek-has-tooltip` with `$section_tooltips` copy clarifying user-initiated sync/push and that telemetry rules are mapping preferences only):
- **Platform Connectors Hub** — connector list (`#checklistdek-connectors-list`) with inline notice area (`#checklistdek-connectors-notice`), Connected/Not Detected badge, synced-site count when `supports_sync`, and **Setup** modal (`#checklistdek-connector-modal`) with **Sync Sites** (`#checklistdek-connector-sync` → admin-ajax `checklistdek_integration_sync`), **Preview Sync** (`#checklistdek-connector-preview` → `checklistdek_integration_sync` with `dry_run: 1`), **Push Client Panel** (`#checklistdek-connector-push` → `checklistdek_integration_push`), and optional docs link. WP Umbrella **Setup** shows `#checklistdek-connector-wp-umbrella-config` (Public API token from Profile → Public API — not the per-site connection key from the WP Umbrella plugin; `#checklistdek-wp-umbrella-api-token`, `#checklistdek-wp-umbrella-save-token` / `#checklistdek-wp-umbrella-clear-token` → admin-ajax `checklistdek_save_wp_umbrella_token` with `CHECKLISTDEK_Integration_WP_Umbrella::verify_api_token()` probe before persist; status via `api_token_configured` in connector bootstrap — never return decrypted token). Connector rows + telemetry table preloaded via `checklistdekAdmin.integrations`; refresh uses admin-ajax (`checklistdek_get_integrations`, `checklistdek_get_telemetry_rules`).
- **Telemetry Sync Mapping Rules** — table of platform → ChecklistDek field mappings (`#checklistdek-telemetry-rules-table`, `#checklistdek-save-telemetry-rules`, `#checklistdek-telemetry-notice`); enabled state saved via admin-ajax `checklistdek_save_telemetry_rules`. Equivalent REST routes remain registered for programmatic access.

**Site inventory sync** (MainWP and WP Umbrella; other connectors return `supports_site_sync() => false` until implemented): user-initiated via Integrations modal. `CHECKLISTDEK_Integration_Sync::sync()` / `::preview()` calls `fetch_platform_sites()` on the adapter, then `CHECKLISTDEK_Site_Repository::upsert_from_integration()` per row. WP Umbrella imports projects from `https://public-api.wp-umbrella.com` (`/projects` pagination). `CHECKLISTDEK_Telemetry_Mapper::map()` applies enabled rules from `get_telemetry_rules()` to map platform fields (`name`, `url`, `wp_version`, `php_version`) onto ChecklistDek site columns. Upsert matches by `integration_source` + `external_id`, then falls back to URL; auto-tags sites with `group_type: integration`. Synced sites without Application Passwords count toward `needs_credentials` in the summary. When sync/preview returns `summary.total === 0` and the adapter implements `get_sync_diagnostics()` (MainWP, WP Umbrella), REST includes a `diagnostics` object with actionable `hint` text for the connector modal notice. Audit: `integration_sync` (live sync only).

**Integrations page bootstrap**: `CHECKLISTDEK_Integrations::get_page_bootstrap()` returns `{ connectors: get_statuses(), telemetry: { rules, fields } }`; localized as `checklistdekAdmin.integrations` on first paint (`synced_sites` counts via `CHECKLISTDEK_Site_Repository::count_by_integration_sources()`).

**Agent push**: `push_agent()` deploys the client checklist panel when `checklistdek_can_auto_deploy_client_panel()`. Sites with hub credentials use `CHECKLISTDEK_Mu_Plugin_Installer::ensure_installed()`; MainWP-linked sites without credentials use `CHECKLISTDEK_MainWP_Agent::install_panel()` via MainWP Connect (`installplugintheme`) on full builds only (Community stub no-ops). Audit: `integration_push`. Telemetry rule saves audit as `telemetry_rules_updated`.

`CHECKLISTDEK_Integrations` helpers: `get_statuses()` (merges `supports_sync`, `synced_sites`, `description`, `docs_url` from `get_status()`), `get_page_bootstrap()` (connectors + telemetry rules for Integrations screen preload), `get_checklistdek_fields()`, `get_default_telemetry_rules()`, `get_telemetry_rules()`, `save_telemetry_rules()`. Rules persist in `checklistdek_settings.telemetry_sync_rules` (id + enabled only; defaults are code-defined).

`CHECKLISTDEK_Site_Repository` integration helpers: `find_by_external()`, `upsert_from_integration()`, `list_by_integration()`, `count_by_integration_sources()`, `ensure_integration_tag()`, `normalize_url()`, `has_credentials()`, `get_distinct_group_types()` (merge in-use tag group slugs into group catalog). REST site rows expose `integration_source` and `external_id`.

Integration REST routes require `MANAGE_SETTINGS` (`can_manage_settings`). Admin UI uses admin-ajax for integration actions, site run history, and Activity Logs list pagination to avoid full REST bootstrap on memory-constrained installs (see `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin_Ajax`).

## Admin AJAX

Registered in `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin_Ajax::register()` from `CHECKLISTDEK_Plugin::run()`. Auth: `verify_ajax_nonce()` (`wp_verify_nonce` on `wp_rest` — JSON 403 with translatable session-expired message instead of `-1` die) + capability checks via `verify_request()` / `verify_sites_request()` / `verify_dashboard_request()` (`MANAGE_SETTINGS` for integrations/telemetry; `MANAGE_SITES` for site run history; `VIEW_DASHBOARD` for activity logs). Handlers read POST via `post_input()` / `post_bool()` after verify. Admin JS calls via `postAjax()` (`checklistdekAdmin.ajaxUrl`; treats `0`/`-1` responses as session expired using `strings.sessionExpired`).

| Action | Capability | Handler |
|--------|------------|---------|
| `checklistdek_get_integrations` | `MANAGE_SETTINGS` | `CHECKLISTDEK_Integrations::get_statuses()` |
| `checklistdek_integration_sync` | `MANAGE_SETTINGS` | `CHECKLISTDEK_Integration_Sync::sync()` or `::preview()` when `dry_run=1` |
| `checklistdek_integration_push` | `MANAGE_SETTINGS` | `{Integration}::push_agent( $site_ids )` |
| `checklistdek_save_wp_umbrella_token` | `MANAGE_SETTINGS` | `normalize_wp_umbrella_api_token()` → optional `CHECKLISTDEK_Integration_WP_Umbrella::verify_api_token()` → `save_wp_umbrella_api_token()` — POST `token` or `clear=1`; returns `{ api_token_configured, message }` |
| `checklistdek_get_telemetry_rules` | `MANAGE_SETTINGS` | rules + field labels |
| `checklistdek_save_telemetry_rules` | `MANAGE_SETTINGS` | `CHECKLISTDEK_Integrations::save_telemetry_rules()` |
| `checklistdek_get_site_runs` | `MANAGE_SITES` | `CHECKLISTDEK_Run_Repository::list_for_site_history()` |
| `checklistdek_get_activity_logs` | `VIEW_DASHBOARD` | `CHECKLISTDEK_Audit_Log::query( list_query_args_from_input( POST filters ) )` |

## Naming

| Kind | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Constants | `CHECKLISTDEK_*` | `CHECKLISTDEK_VERSION`, `CHECKLISTDEK_REST_NAMESPACE` |
| Classes | `CHECKLISTDEK_{Name}` | `CHECKLISTDEK_Site_Repository` |
| Functions | `checklistdek_{action}` | `checklistdek_run_plugin()` |
| Options | `checklistdek_{key}` | `checklistdek_settings`, `checklistdek_billing`, `checklistdek_db_version`, `checklistdek_dashboard_cache` |
| CSS/JS handles | `checklistdek-{name}` | `checklistdek-admin` |
| CSS classes | `checklistdek-*` | `checklistdek-card`, `checklistdek-stats-grid` |
| JS global | `checklistdekAdmin` | REST URL, nonce, strings |
| Cron hook | `checklistdek_drift_verify_cron` | twicedaily drift checks (scheduled only on full build via `CHECKLISTDEK_Licensing::sync_drift_cron()`) |

`CHECKLISTDEK_TEXT_DOMAIN` must match `CHECKLISTDEK_PLUGIN_SLUG` (`checklistdek`).

## Extension Hooks

- `checklistdek_settings_defaults`, `checklistdek_settings_sanitize`

## Scope & Change Discipline

- Minimize diff scope; match existing class-based layout.
- Add `index.php` silence files when creating new directories.
- Update `readme.txt` changelog for user-facing changes.
- New repositories/integrations follow existing `class-checklistdek-*` naming.

## Constants (use, don't redefine)

`CHECKLISTDEK_VERSION`, `CHECKLISTDEK_PLUGIN_FILE`, `CHECKLISTDEK_PLUGIN_DIR`, `CHECKLISTDEK_PLUGIN_URL`, `CHECKLISTDEK_PLUGIN_BASENAME`, `CHECKLISTDEK_PLUGIN_SLUG`, `CHECKLISTDEK_TEXT_DOMAIN`, `CHECKLISTDEK_PLUGIN_DOCS_URL`, `CHECKLISTDEK_REST_NAMESPACE`, `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin::ACTIVATION_REDIRECT_OPTION` (`checklistdek_activation_redirect`)
